                            Description = "The technical documentation referred to in Article 31 shall contain at least the following information, as applicable to the relevant product with digital elements: a general description of the product with digital elements, including: (a) its intended purpose; (b) versions of software affecting compliance with essential cybersecurity requirements; (c) where the product with digital elements is a hardware product, photographs or illustrations showing external features, marking and internal layout; (d) user information and instructions as set out in Annex II;",
                            FrameworkVersionId = new Guid("6a1f8c2e-0c4b-4d4e-9a51-5f1c2a3b4c05"),
